iyat, known for landmarks like The Lana and The Opus, ensuring exceptional design quality and operational excellence.</li><li>Future-Ready Smart Building - Equipped with advanced Building Management Systems (BMS), technology integration, and WiredScore Platinum targets for connectivity.</li><li>Wellness and Performance Focus - Lumena Alta amenities include a 25m indoor pool, vitality pools, spa suites, hydrotherapy areas, and executive fitness zones.</li><li>Panoramic City &amp; Sea Views - Offers unobstructed views of Burj Khalifa, Burj Al Arab, the Arabian Gulf, and the Dubai Canal.</li><li>Seamless Connectivity - Direct metro link and proximity to major road networks connect Lumena Alta instantly to Downtown, DIFC, and Dubai International Airport.</li><li>Managed by Omniyat Services - Offers five-star concierge, valet, maintenance, and bespoke corporate services—enhancing day-to-day convenience and prestige.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1832,"cta":{"id":2630,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Lumena_Alta_by_Omniyat_Landmark_Offices_in_Business_Bay_2fc7135091.jpg","hash":"Lumena_Alta_by_Omniyat_Landmark_Offices_in_Business_Bay_2fc7135091","name":"Lumena Alta by Omniyat – Landmark Offices in Business Bay"},"style":null,"title":"At the Intersection of Business, Luxury, and Connectivity","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Perfectly positioned in Business Bay, Lumena Alta connects the core of Dubai’s business, lifestyle, and innovation corridors. The development enjoys strategic proximity to <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Downtown Dubai</a>, DIFC, and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-design-district/\">Dubai Design District (d3)</a>, creating a location that’s both central and future-focused.</p><ul><li>1 minute to Sheikh Zayed Road (E11)</li><li>6 minutes to Burj Khalifa</li><li>6 minutes to Al Khail Road (E44)</li><li>10 minutes to DIFC</li><li>20 minutes to Dubai Marina</li><li>20 minutes to Dubai International Airport (DXB)</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":4393,"url":"","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/brochure_f5c2bbefc9.pdf","hash":"brochure_f5c2bbefc9","name":"brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":3070,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":4214,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Offices","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":4215,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Retail Spaces","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"50/50","payment_plans":[{"id":11837,"title":"5%","description":"On Booking"},{"id":11838,"title":"45%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":11839,"title":"50%","description":"On Completion"}],"community":"Business Bay","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":30054,"url":null,"text":"Fitness Center","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30055,"url":null,"text":"Executive Business Center","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30056,"url":null,"text":"Wellness & Spa Facilities","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30057,"url":null,"text":"Hydrotherapy & Treatment Rooms","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30058,"url":null,"text":"Outdoor Rejuvenation Terraces","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30059,"url":null,"text":"Barista Lounges","type":null,"image":null},{"id":30060,"url":null,"text":